            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Sotto 0.1.1

- Input Monitoring setup that works on macOS 26: the setup card opens the list and a Finder window with Sotto selected so you can drag it in. macOS shows no prompt for this permission.
- Accessibility card triggers the system prompt so Sotto appears in that list.
- Cleanup no longer adds words after what you said, such as starting to answer a dictated question.
- Usage descriptions for Input Monitoring and Accessibility. App category set to Productivity.
- Release builds no longer carry the debug entitlement.
]]></description>
